                                        svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" class="lesson-visual"><rect x="0" y="0" width="1100" height="1100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><rect x="150" y="300" width="800" height="400" rx="25" fill="rgba(139,92,246,0.15)" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="4"/><text x="550" y="380" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b5cf6" font-size="72" font-weight="bold">"</text><text x="550" y="480" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="32" font-style="italic">We can be blind to the obvious,</text><text x="550" y="540" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="32" font-style="italic">and we are also blind</text><text x="550" y="600" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="32" font-style="italic">to our blindness.</text><text x="550" y="660" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b5cf6" font-size="72" font-weight="bold">"</text><line x1="250" y1="720" x2="850" y2="720" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2"/><text x="550" y="770" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffd700" font-size="28" font-weight="bold">Daniel Kahneman</text><text x="550" y="810" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888" font-size="24">Nobel Prize Winner, Thinking Fast and Slow</text><rect x="300" y="900" width="500" height="100" rx="20" fill="rgba(255,215,0,0.1)" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="2"/><text x="550" y="945" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="22">The first step to overcoming bias is recognizing</text><text x="550" y="980" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888" font-size="22">that we ALL have them - including you</text></svg>`
