                                    type: "application",
                                    title: "Engaging System 2",
                                    content: "How to activate careful thinking:\n\n1. **Create friction**: Don't rush decisions. Sleep on important choices.\n\n2. **Use hard-to-read fonts**: Studies show this activates System 2 (really!)\n\n3. **Ask 'What am I missing?'**: This prompts System 2 to check System 1's work\n\n4. **Schedule important decisions for high-energy times**: Not when depleted\n\n5. **Distrust intuitive answers to hard questions**: If it feels too easy, you might be answering the wrong question",
