                                    content: "Before deciding, ask:\n\n• Am I in System 1 mode? Should I slow down?\n• What's my reference point? Is it appropriate?\n• What's the base rate? (Not just this case)\n• What anchor am I starting from?\n• Am I being influenced by available examples?\n• What would I advise a friend to do? (Outside view)\n• What will I think of this decision in 10 minutes? 10 months? 10 years?\n• Pre-mortem: Assuming this fails, why did it fail?",
