                                    title: "The Habit Loop",
                                    content: "**1. CUE** - triggers your brain to initiate a behavior\nExample: You see your phone\n\n**2. CRAVING** - the motivational force behind every habit\nExample: You crave entertainment/distraction\n\n**3. RESPONSE** - the actual habit you perform\nExample: You grab your phone and check social media\n\n**4. REWARD** - the end goal of every habit\nExample: You satisfy your craving for entertainment\n\nIf any of these four steps is missing, a behavior will not become a habit."
