                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Temptation Bundling",
                                    content: "Temptation bundling works by linking an action you WANT to do with an action you NEED to do.\n\n**Formula:**\nAfter [HABIT I NEED], I will [HABIT I WANT].\n\nExamples:\n• After I study for 30 minutes, I will watch one episode of my show\n• After I work out, I will take a relaxing shower with my favorite music\n• After I complete my client work, I will scroll social media for 10 minutes\n• After I finish one Synthesis lesson, I will check my manifestation journal"
