                                    content: "Your brain releases dopamine when you:\n1. Experience pleasure (eating good food)\n2. **ANTICIPATE pleasure** (smelling food cooking)\n\nThe anticipation is often MORE powerful than the reward itself.\n\nThis is why casinos work - the anticipation of winning releases more dopamine than actually winning.\n\nUse this: Make the anticipation of your habit rewarding."
