                                    content: "**Why we undervalue work:**\n\n**Cultural conditioning:**\n• \"Work is a necessary evil\"\n• \"Real life starts after 5pm\"\n• \"I work to live, not live to work\"\n\n**Psychological discounting:**\n• We discount compulsory experiences\n• Choice enhances perceived enjoyment\n• If we \"have to\" do it, it must be bad\n\n**The irony:**\nFree time often produces **apathy and boredom** because we lack goals, challenges, and structure. We then fill it with passive consumption that produces little satisfaction.\n\n*We flee what nourishes us toward what empties us.*",
