                                    content: "Here's a strange finding: **Your current feelings distort your predictions about the future.**\n\nWhen you're hungry, you overestimate how much food you'll want later. When you're happy, you assume the future will be happy too.\n\nThe present moment is like a colored lens—everything we imagine is tinted by how we feel right now."
