                                    content: "Self-awareness is the cornerstone of emotional intelligence. Without it, you're a ship without a compass—reactive to every wave, with no sense of direction. The ability to recognize and name your emotions as they occur is what separates those who are controlled by their feelings from those who channel them purposefully.",
