                                    content: "Why do some people persist through failure while others give up? Why do some find meaning in their work while others just collect a paycheck? The answer lies in emotional intelligence's third domain: motivation. Not the superficial 'pump yourself up' kind, but a deep, internal drive that comes from marshaling your emotions in service of a goal.",
