                                    type: "example",
                                    title: "Your Path Doesn't Need to Look Like Anyone Else's",
                                    content: "Eight million ways to happiness means **your combination will be unique**.\n\nMaybe you resonate deeply with **wabi-sabi** and barely connect with **gaman**. That's fine. Take what speaks to you.\n\nMaybe **shinrin-yoku** transforms your Tuesdays while **kaizen** transforms your career. That's your path.\n\nMaybe **musubi** heals your loneliness and **oubaitori** heals your self-criticism. That's your medicine.\n\n**The eight million ways are not a checklist**. They're a menu. A garden. A palette. You don't use every color — you find the ones that make your painting come alive.\n\nHiroko Yoda's gift isn't telling you which path to walk. It's showing you that **paths are everywhere** — and you get to choose which ones are yours.",
