      content: "What did you dream of becoming when you were young — before the world told you to be practical?\n\n*The Alchemist* opens with a simple question: **What is your Personal Legend?**\n\nFor Paulo Coelho, a Personal Legend is not a career goal or a bucket list. It is the deepest calling of your soul — the thing you were born to do. The universe itself conspires to help you achieve it.\n\nBut most people never pursue it. Fear, comfort, and other people's expectations bury the dream alive.\n\nIn this lesson, we meet Santiago — a young shepherd who chooses to follow his dream — and discover what the concept of the Personal Legend really means.",
