      correct: 2,
      explanation: "Coelho's 'conspiracy' is not magical wish-fulfillment or networking — it is the Soul of the World actively aligning circumstances when you pursue an authentic Personal Legend. The key condition is authenticity: the universe does not conspire for ego, fear, or other people's goals. Only when your desire is truly yours — your soul's calling — does the world rearrange itself to help. This is why Santiago keeps meeting guides at perfect moments. He is genuinely following his legend, not performing one."
