      title: "Tuning Into the Soul of the World",
      content: "You don't need to cross a desert to start hearing the universe.\n\nCoelho suggests that the Soul of the World communicates through:\n\n• **Gut feelings** you've been dismissing as 'just anxiety'\n• **Repeated patterns** — the same idea appearing from three different sources in a week\n• **Moments of unexpected clarity** — when the right path suddenly seems obvious\n• **Dreams** — the unconscious processing what the conscious ignores\n\n**Practice:** For one week, keep a small notebook. Write down:\n1. Any omen or coincidence that feels *too convenient* to be random\n2. Any gut feeling you overrode with logic\n3. Any moment where the universe seemed to be saying something\n\nAt the end of the week, look at the pattern. You may be surprised by what you've been ignoring.",
