        content: "*The Alchemist* teaches that the universe communicates constantly through **omens** — signs that point the way toward or away from your Personal Legend.\n\nBut omens are not magic tricks. They require:\n\n• **Attention** — noticing the world rather than sleepwalking through it\n• **Interpretation** — understanding what the sign means in context\n• **Courage** — acting on the omen even when logic pushes back\n\nIn this lesson, we meet **Melchizedek's sacred stones** (Urim and Thummim), explore how Santiago learns to read signs, and discover why Coelho believes intuition is not mysticism — it's the deepest form of intelligence.",
