        content: "Coelho states it directly: **\"When you want something, all the universe conspires in helping you to achieve it.\"**\n\nThis is not magic thinking — it is an observation about attention, readiness, and perception.\n\nWhen you commit to a path:\n\n• You begin to *notice* opportunities you were previously blind to\n• You communicate your intention to others — and people help those who know where they're going\n• The Soul of the World recognizes your sincerity and responds in kind\n• Your energy shifts — and people, coincidences, and resources align with that energy\n\nFor Santiago, the Principle of Favorability showed up immediately:\n• He met Melchizedek (the mysterious king) the very day he decided to pursue his legend\n• He received the Urim and Thummim — physical tools for reading omens\n• His sheep sold at a fair price, leaving him with exactly enough for the journey\n\nCoelho's point: **the universe offers early proof that the path is real.** This gift is meant to be stored as a memory — evidence to draw on when the hard times arrive.",
