      content: "The breakthrough happens when Santiago stops trying to transform himself into the wind from the outside — using technique, using willpower, using strategy — and instead realizes he was never separate from the wind in the first place. 'I am the wind,' he understands. Not 'I will become the wind.' Not 'I will use the wind.' The same Soul of the World that is in him is in the wind. They are not two things. They are one thing appearing as two. The moment he knows this, the transformation happens. This is the Alchemist's deepest teaching.",
