            title: "The Journey Ends. Your Real Journey Begins.",
            content: "You've traveled with Santiago from the fields of Andalusia to the pyramids of Egypt.\n\nYou've watched him lose everything and gain everything. You've seen him speak to the wind, read omens, and find treasure — not where he expected, but exactly where it was meant to be.\n\nNow it's your turn.\n\nThis final lesson is not about Santiago. **It's about you.** Every concept Coelho wove into this story was a mirror — reflecting back the life you are capable of living.\n\nThe question is no longer: *What is a Personal Legend?*\n\nThe question is: **What is yours — and what will you do about it today?**",
