            type: "application",
            title: "Five Actions to Start Your Legend Today",
            content: "Here is your Personal Legend action plan — five concrete steps for the next 24 hours:\n\n**1. Name your legend**\nWrite the answer to this question: *What would I do with my life if I knew I couldn't fail?* Don't edit. Don't be practical. Just write what rises first.\n\n**2. Identify your crystal merchant moment**\nWhat are you protecting by not moving? Name the comfort you're clinging to — the thing that feels like safety but is actually just postponement.\n\n**3. Take one irreversible step**\nSend the email. Make the call. Sign up. Register. Say yes. It must be something that actually moves you forward, not just thinking about moving forward.\n\n**4. Write down one omen you've been ignoring**\nWhat has the universe been trying to tell you? A repeated idea? A pattern? A feeling you keep suppressing? Write it down. Acknowledge it.\n\n**5. Speak your legend aloud to one person**\nThe moment a legend is spoken, it becomes real. Tell one person — not for their approval, but to make it concrete in the world.",
