                                    content: "**Perfectionism is NOT:**\n• The same as striving for excellence\n• Self-improvement\n• Having high standards\n• Being detail-oriented\n\n**Perfectionism IS:**\n• A belief: 'If I'm perfect, I'll avoid shame'\n• A shield: Protection from judgment\n• Addictive: Never enough, always more to do\n• Self-destructive: Leads to anxiety, depression\n\n**The core lie:** 'Perfect performance = Protection from pain'\n\n**The truth:** Perfectionism increases pain. It's shame driving the bus."
