                                    title: "Letting Go of Numbing and Powerlessness",
                                    content: "When life is painful, we numb. We use food, alcohol, work, shopping, social media—anything to avoid feeling. But here's the problem: we cannot selectively numb emotions. When we numb the dark, we numb the light. When we numb pain, we numb joy. Resilience isn't about avoiding pain; it's about leaning into the discomfort."
