                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Gratitude as a Practice",
                                    content: "**Gratitude is not:**\n• A feeling that comes and goes\n• Counting blessings when things are good\n• Ignoring problems\n• Toxic positivity\n\n**Gratitude IS:**\n• A daily practice\n• Noticing what's working\n• Specific and concrete\n• An antidote to scarcity\n\n**Practices that work:**\n• Gratitude journals (specific things, not vague)\n• Sharing gratitude with others\n• Savoring ordinary moments\n• Returning to gratitude when foreboding joy strikes"
