                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "What Makes Learning 'Validated'?",
                                    content: "Validated learning must be:\n\n**1. Empirical** - Based on real data from real customers\n\n**2. Demonstrable** - You can show the evidence to others\n\n**3. Actionable** - The learning leads to clear next steps\n\n**4. Falsifiable** - You could have been proven wrong\n\nThe test: Can you explain **specifically what you learned** and **how you know it's true**?"
