                                    title: "The Core Feedback Loop",
                                    content: "The **Build-Measure-Learn** feedback loop is the core of the Lean Startup methodology.\n\nEvery startup activity should be designed to accelerate this loop:\n\n**Ideas â†’ BUILD â†’ Product â†’ MEASURE â†’ Data â†’ LEARN â†’ Ideas**\n\nThe goal is to **minimize total time through the loop**—not to build faster, but to learn faster."
