                                    title: "Instagram's Famous Pivot",
                                    content: "**Burbn** was a location-based social network with many features:\n- Check-ins\n- Plans\n- Photo sharing\n- Points and rewards\n\nFounders noticed: **Users mostly used the photo feature**.\n\n**The Pivot:** Strip everything except photos + filters + sharing.\n\n**Result:** Instagram—acquired by Facebook for $1 billion.\n\nThis was a **zoom-in pivot**: one feature became the entire product."
