                                    content: "**Thiel's Law:** \"A startup messed up at its foundation cannot be fixed.\"\n\n**Critical foundation choices:**\n\n1. **Co-founders** - Like marriage; work together first\n\n2. **Ownership structure** - Equity, board, control\n\n3. **Culture** - What kind of company will this be?\n\n4. **Early hires** - First 20 people define everything\n\n**The mistake:** Thinking you can fix foundational issues later. You can't."
