                                    title: "The Art of Persuasion",
                                    content: "Most people try to convince others through argument, logic, and proving themselves right.\n\n**This approach almost never works.**\n\nCarnegie discovered that winning people to your way of thinking requires making them **feel** right—not proving them wrong.\n\n*\"You cannot win an argument. If you lose it, you lose it; and if you win it, you lose it too.\"*"
