                                    title: "Leadership Through Dignity",
                                    content: "The hardest part of leadership isn't strategy—it's changing people's behavior without damaging relationships.\n\nCarnegie's principles for leadership focus on **preserving dignity** while still addressing problems.\n\n*\"A leader's job is not to be in charge. A leader's job is to take care of those in their charge.\"*"
