                                    title: "Rules 5-7: Attention, Courtesy, Knowledge",
                                    content: "**Rule 5: Pay little attentions**\n- Flowers for no reason\n- Remembering small preferences\n- Text to say you're thinking of them\n- Small gestures sustain love\n\n**Rule 6: Be courteous**\n- Say \"please\" and \"thank you\" at home\n- Don't take rudeness license just because you're married\n- Treat family with the courtesy you'd give a stranger\n\n**Rule 7: Educate yourself on intimacy**\n- Read and learn together\n- Don't assume you know everything\n- Keep growing together"
