                                    content: "A powerful summary combines:\n\n**1. Paraphrasing** - Their position in your words\n*\"So you're saying the timeline is the main concern...\"*\n\n**2. Labeling** - Acknowledging underlying emotions\n*\"...and it seems like you're worried about what happens if you miss the launch date.\"*\n\n**Put together**:\n*\"So you're saying the timeline is the main concern, and it seems like you're worried about what happens if you miss the launch date—the pressure from stakeholders, the competition getting ahead.\"*\n\nThis summary shows you understand both the **what** and the **why**."
