                                    content: "No single leader can manage everything. In the chaos of combat—or business—situations change too fast for one person to make every decision. The solution is Decentralized Command: developing leaders at every level who understand the mission and can make decisions autonomously. The leader sets the direction; subordinate leaders execute."
