                                    content: "Here's something they didn't teach you in school: **Homo sapiens was not the only human species.**\n\nFor most of history, multiple human species coexisted:\n\n• **Homo neanderthalensis** (Neanderthals) - Europe & Western Asia\n• **Homo erectus** - East Asia\n• **Homo soloensis** - Java\n• **Homo floresiensis** - Indonesia (nicknamed 'Hobbits')\n• **Homo denisova** - Siberia\n• **Homo sapiens** - East Africa\n\n**The uncomfortable truth:** We're the only ones left. What happened to the others? Evidence suggests we either outcompeted them, interbred with them, or... something darker."
