                                    question: "What's the difference between a winner-take-all market and an auction market?",
                                    options: [
                                        { text: "Winner-take-all pays more", correct: false },
                                        { text: "Winner-take-all values one dominant skill; auction values diverse skills", correct: true },
                                        { text: "Auction markets are more competitive", correct: false },
                                        { text: "There is no meaningful difference", correct: false }
                                    ],
                                    explanation: "In winner-take-all markets (like screenwriting), one skill dominates and diversifying is a mistake. In auction markets (like entrepreneurship), multiple skills create value and unique combinations are hard to replicate. Identifying your market determines your career capital strategy."
