                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Major Blood Vessels",
                                    content: "**MAJOR ARTERIES:**\n• **Aorta** - largest artery, from LV\n  - Ascending â†’ Aortic arch â†’ Descending\n• **Carotid arteries** - supply brain\n• **Coronary arteries** - supply heart muscle\n• **Subclavian** â†’ Axillary â†’ Brachial (arm)\n• **Femoral** â†’ Popliteal â†’ Tibial (leg)\n• **Celiac, Mesenteric** - supply GI organs\n• **Renal arteries** - supply kidneys\n\n**MAJOR VEINS:**\n• **Superior Vena Cava** - from upper body to RA\n• **Inferior Vena Cava** - from lower body to RA\n• **Jugular veins** - drain brain\n• **Subclavian, Axillary, Brachial** (arm)\n• **Femoral, Popliteal, Saphenous** (leg)\n• **Portal vein** - GI â†’ Liver\n• **Hepatic veins** - Liver â†’ IVC"
