                                    title: "Documentation Standards & Requirements",
                                    content: "Healthcare documentation must meet standards from multiple sources: **federal regulations** (CMS), **accreditation bodies** (TJC), **state laws**, and **facility policies**. Understanding these requirements is essential for HIM professionals."
