                                    content: "**HCPCS (Healthcare Common Procedure Coding System)** has two levels:\n\n• **Level I**: CPT codes (we've been studying)\n• **Level II**: Alphanumeric codes for items and services NOT in CPT\n\nHCPCS Level II codes cover **durable medical equipment (DME)**, **drugs**, **supplies**, **ambulance services**, and other items essential to healthcare but outside CPT's scope.\n\nMaintained by **CMS** (not AMA), HCPCS Level II is required for Medicare/Medicaid billing.",
