            content: "\"We are at a critical inflection point in healthcare delivery. The question is no longer whether we move to value-based care, but how fast and how well we execute the transition. Every stakeholder — from the C-suite to the coding desk — plays a role.\"\n\n— Adapted from CMS Innovation Center strategic direction\n\n**Key takeaway:** CMS has stated its goal of having **100% of Medicare beneficiaries** in accountable care relationships by 2030. The shift to value-based care is not optional — it is the future of healthcare payment. HIM professionals who master risk adjustment, quality reporting, and CDI will be among the most valuable members of any healthcare organization.\n\nThe payment model spectrum — from FFS to capitation — represents increasing levels of financial risk and accountability. Understanding where your organization sits on this spectrum, and how coded data drives performance under each model, is essential knowledge for every HIM professional.",
