                                    type: "example",
                                    title: "HIE Benefits and Challenges",
                                    content: "**Benefits:**\n• Reduces duplicate testing\n• Supports care coordination\n• Improves emergency care\n• Enables population health\n• Reduces medical errors\n\n**Challenges:**\n• Patient matching across systems\n• Consent management complexity\n• Costs of participation\n• Data quality variations\n• Workflow integration\n• Privacy concerns\n\n**TEFCA (Trusted Exchange Framework):**\nNational framework to connect HIEs and enable nationwide interoperability through Qualified Health Information Networks (QHINs)."
