                                    content: "**Primary vs Secondary (Metastatic):**\n\n**Primary Site:** Where cancer originated\n• Code from C00-C75 by site\n• Example: C34.90 (lung cancer, unspecified)\n\n**Secondary Site:** Where cancer spread\n• Code from C77-C79\n• Example: C78.7 (secondary liver cancer)\n\n**Coding Rule:** Code both primary and secondary sites\n• Primary lung cancer with liver mets:\n  C34.90 + C78.7\n\n**History of Cancer:**\n• Personal history: Z85.x\n• Use when cancer is no longer present\n• Active treatment = still code cancer"
