      content: "Surgical and consultation statistics are among the most scrutinized quality indicators in health care. Every invasive procedure carries risk, and tracking outcomes — deaths, infections, tissue findings, and specialist opinions — gives hospitals the data they need to improve care and meet accreditation standards. In this lesson you will master the key formulas, classifications, and benchmarks that govern surgical quality reporting.",
