      type: "concept",
      title: "OB & Newborn Rates (L9)",
      content: `# OB & Newborn Rates

## C-Section Rate
> (C-section deliveries / Total deliveries) x 100

## VBAC Rate
> (VBACs / Patients with prior C-section who delivered) x 100

## Perinatal Mortality Rate
> ((Fetal deaths + Neonatal deaths) / (Total births + Fetal deaths)) x 100

## Neonatal Mortality Rate
> (Neonatal deaths / NB discharges including deaths) x 100

---

## Key Terms

| Term | Definition |
|------|-----------|
| Delivery | A birth event (twins = 1 delivery, 2 births) |
| Live birth | Born alive regardless of gestational age |
| Fetal death | Death before complete expulsion |
| Neonatal death | Death of live-born within 28 days |

**Exam tip:** A mother with twins counts as 1 delivery but 2 births.`,
