  <text x="550" y="268" fill="#3bafbf" font-size="28" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif">Net Rate = (Deaths - Deaths under 48 hrs) / (Discharges - Deaths under 48 hrs) x 100</text>
