      content: "Start building your domination strategy TODAY with these specific steps:\n\n**1. Create your domain self-assessment**: Rate yourself 1-5 on each of the 5 domains. Be brutally honest about where you are weakest.\n\n**2. Build your study calendar**: Map 8-12 weeks. Allocate MORE weeks to high-weight domains where you are weak, FEWER weeks to domains where you are strong.\n\n**3. Schedule your exam**: Book your Pearson VUE appointment NOW for 10-12 weeks out. Having a fixed date creates accountability.\n\n**4. Gather your study resources**: This SYNTHESIS course covers all 5 domains. Supplement with AHIMA practice exams and your course textbooks.\n\n**5. Set daily study blocks**: 1-2 hours daily is ideal. Same time each day builds habit. Include quiz practice in every session -- passive reading is not enough.",
