                                                  explanation:  "AHIMA was originally founded in 1928 as ARLNA (Association of Record Librarians of North America), created by the American College of Surgeons. It went through three name changes: AMRL (1938), AMRA (1970), and finally AHIMA (1991). AMRA (the most tempting wrong answer) was the third name, not the original. The 1991 rename to AHIMA reflected the industry's shift from paper medical records to digital health information management.",
                                                  visual:  {
                                                            type:  "diagram",
                                                            svg:  "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"42\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"29\">AHIMA History</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.2)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">1928: ARLNA</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"235\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Association of Record Librarians of North America ✓</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"280\" width=\"800\" height=\"70\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"325\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"22\">1938: AMRL → 1970: AMRA → 1991: AHIMA</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"380\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Remember: ARLNA → AMRL → AMRA → AHIMA</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Each name reflected the evolving scope of the profession</text></svg>",
                                                            caption:  "AHIMA naming timeline: ARLNA (1928) to AHIMA (1991)"
                                                  }
