                                                  explanation:  "UNOS (United Network for Organ Sharing) manages the national organ transplant waitlist under the Organ Procurement and Transplantation Network (OPTN). OPTN was established by the National Organ Transplant Act of 1984 and is administered by HRSA (Health Resources and Services Administration). UNOS operates OPTN under federal contract. NAACCR (wrong) sets cancer registry standards. ACS (wrong) manages trauma data/NTDB. NCQA (wrong) develops HEDIS measures for managed care quality.",
                                                  visual:  {
                                                            type:  "diagram",
                                                            svg:  "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"42\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"29\">Registry Organizations</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"800\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">UNOS → National Transplant Waitlist</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Operates OPTN under HRSA contract (National Organ Transplant Act 1984)</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"320\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.08)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">DON'T CONFUSE THESE ORGANIZATIONS</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">NAACCR = Cancer registry standards</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"418\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">ACS = Trauma (NTDB) + Cancer (CoC)</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"446\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">NCQA = HEDIS / managed care quality</text></svg>",
                                                            caption:  "UNOS operates the national organ transplant network"
                                                  }
