                                                  explanation:  "**CARF International** specializes in accrediting rehabilitation programs, including inpatient rehab, behavioral health, opioid treatment, and employment/community services. While TJC can accredit rehabilitation hospitals as part of a health system, CARF is the specialist accreditor for rehabilitation. NCQA accredits health plans, and AAAHC accredits ambulatory/outpatient settings.",
