                                                  title:  "Ethical Coding Quiz",
                                                  question:  "A hospital administrator tells the coding supervisor to change the principal diagnosis on a claim to increase reimbursement. The documentation does not support the change. According to AHIMA Standards of Ethical Coding, the coding supervisor should:",
